{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e89be672ef76e4f49349bb94d455149eb0ccf1ce7befb88f4d16c90dc657c703", "ja": "（BOT公演の準備は順調だ。\n今は亜利沙に呼ばれて劇場の客席に来ている）", "zh": "（BOT演出的准备进展顺利。现在，我应亚利沙的邀请来到了剧场的观众席。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "f928f800fd79c170d5a4d752e58dda4d50014d0fe9f075d7d7a0c2c8e913519b", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さんも\nお忙しいのに、急にお呼び立てしてしまいまして……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生也很忙，我却突然把您叫过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1002_p", "source_sha256": "da8fcb72f1bbb2863c75d5dc1b1b2b137c8908937b836392c1f6f0161008573d", "ja": "いや、気にすることないよ。\nそれで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "没事，不用放在心上。\n所以，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "4aa3a61420a16a9328bf9314b522cb4a705d003fa92ecc3adbc4511b2cf4f095", "ja": "それはですね……あの……ほら、ありさだけ、\nまだ写真を撮れてないじゃないですか？", "zh": "是这样的……那个……你看，只有亚利沙还没拍到照片，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1004_p", "source_sha256": "48976c6d9c41f6149a280b16b1c2268ac70e0e101cb9cc300c444024606f1193", "ja": "ああ、今回の対決テーマ『自分史上最高の瞬間』の\n写真のことか。", "zh": "啊，是指这次对决主题“自己人生中最棒的瞬间”的照片吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "d8f48c0ee0f78b321f40631fe9c664a0505a6121a29f95a90ed7a1a8fb76b9d4", "ja": "はい。それで、ずっと悩んでいたんですが……\nというか、今この瞬間も迷ってるんですが……。", "zh": "是的。为此我一直很苦恼……\n不对，应该说直到这一刻也还在犹豫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb3fd7d6994db5acb44b3e24546ac5b012801a4359000ae77e73a4a896c406ff", "ja": "でも、もうこれ以上最高の瞬間はない！　と、\n断言できる……ハズの、構成を思いつきまして……。", "zh": "不过，我想到了一个……应该可以断言“不会再有比这更棒的瞬间了！”的构成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "200840ffd315c7f24812f2ab5cf32fca86350f189d7e876c7cf5d67b8b13fdec", "ja": "もう思い切って、これでいこうと思いますっ！\nありさの『自分史上最高の瞬間』！　それは……！", "zh": "我已经下定决心，就用这个了！\n亚利沙的“自己人生中最棒的瞬间”！那就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0a7dd99ef523263b9864a787f96fb80a0a15bf90e6843a41981073693253c221", "ja": "それは……！？", "zh": "那就是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "699b3899ba3967b3c41003825001c561aacd3533c9c27ee6721e9d1592debffe", "ja": "アイドルとしてステージに立ってる瞬間と、\nアイドルちゃんを撮っている瞬間です！！", "zh": "作为偶像站在舞台上的瞬间，以及拍摄偶像们的瞬间！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ef30f6dd6a307c18e6b110c745d0147564f82895cae3e650eee885bb04cb2ca2", "ja": "……ん？　それだと二枚必要じゃないか？", "zh": "……嗯？那样不就需要两张了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "b1d0713f7e63472ea3618987b2760297d7c8520a0163d37472ebb08ea3dfe0ec", "ja": "そうなんです。なので……二重撮りで、客席のありさが\nアイドルのありさを撮る、そんな一枚にしようかと！", "zh": "就是这样。所以……我想采用双重拍摄，让观众席上的亚利沙拍下偶像亚利沙，拍出这样一张照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9785e48a5d1a3cb4f72d83c38508dba8b707555a375fbee6db472a00066cf58d", "ja": "なるほど……それは面白いな！\nそういうテクニック自体も亜利沙らしいし。", "zh": "原来如此……那可真有意思！\n这种技巧本身也很有亜利沙的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "79eb641565345eaf01086563924bfeb7a277fc5867685bf66857adf3ef4991b1", "ja": "はい……アイドルオタクのありさも、アイドルのありさ\nも両方大事で、きっとありさの、最高の瞬間なので……", "zh": "是的……身为偶像宅的阿利沙，以及身为偶像的阿利沙，两方面都很重要，所以这一定是阿利沙最棒的瞬间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "158962f7ea927ebeaec6812bb1d81ba7d018f921783657411e305fb451245fc5", "ja": "というわけで、撮影は一番ありさのことをわかってくれ\nている、{$P$}さんにですね……。", "zh": "所以，拍摄就交给最了解小亚利沙的{$P$}先生了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4e961f8064f0d48483dd265528f3c229792204dc543a37566df91bebaa6f7759", "ja": "よし、任せてくれ。責任重大だけど、亜利沙のプロ\nデューサーとして、最高の亜利沙を撮ってみせる！", "zh": "好，交给我吧。虽然责任重大，但作为亚利沙的\n制作人，我一定会拍出最棒的亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "f5043f7884ccf1adb1e1aaf74fd161c52ccb6bb2e42e230e766245c0de71a326", "ja": "！　よかった……、ありがとうございます～！\nでは、早速準備してきますね！", "zh": "！太好了……谢谢您～！\n那我马上去准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1017_p", "source_sha256": "788942990817ddd8b717d0bee1745d37e8e40d6b734c89acf91896d0adf42073", "ja": "いや、撮るのは今じゃないほうがいいかな。\n亜利沙が出る、次の公演の時にしよう。", "zh": "不，现在拍可能不太合适。  \n等亚利沙参加下次公演的时候再拍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9ab86959efa0d539db36abaf531a80a2bd438a828d361049415793b6f1edaa68", "ja": "空っぽの客席や、空っぽのステージの前じゃ、\n亜利沙の最高の瞬間にならないだろ？", "zh": "在空荡荡的观众席和空荡荡的舞台前，可成不了亚利沙最棒的瞬间吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "eaa3f5d8b7e67daefb262d831892adcc56642973850e82605558a7eb81677857", "ja": "ハッ！？　確かに……フリだけでは、\nどっちも……ダメかもですね……。", "zh": "哈！？确实……光是装装样子，\n两边……可能都不行呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "e5e51492e17f474a9cba084071b8349537f2d5425bbf8628a7af5913f0714b45", "ja": "とはいえ撮る方のありさは、今夜のステージですぐ\n撮れると思います。いくらでも何百枚でも無限に。", "zh": "不过，负责拍照的亚利沙，我想今晚的舞台上马上就能拍个够。想拍多少都行，几百张也好，无限张也好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1dbc7a1aaba00334182e70fc259d9cdd3c1e3047adbc54c4e49479b013fbaef7", "ja": "そ、そうか。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "96f13585f733247fb009b224a68077df47c61e4a0263e8aaf82b4b732f1c3553", "ja": "でもアイドルのありさは……、すみませんが、\nありさが出る次のステージでお願いします。", "zh": "不过偶像亚利沙的话……不好意思，请等亚利沙登台的下一场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0633_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "8dedd08ba36d528b9884405bb0b3a0a215c6e9380d90c24c4c1d861a134316ca", "ja": "そっちは最高の瞬間なんて限られてると思いますから…\nシャッターチャンス、逃さないでくださいねっ！", "zh": "我觉得那边最棒的瞬间可是很有限的……\n可别错过按下快门的机会哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
